akatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Yodhehi cāpi sabalehi ca sāyudhehi,"},{"i":64,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Lokaṃ vivaṃciya sadā maraṇūsabho so"},{"i":65,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Kāmaṃ nihanti bhuvanattaya sāli daṇḍaṃ;"},{"i":66,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"hangnum","n":"16","t":"|O0.0006|"},{"i":67,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","t":"Bho mārutena mahatā vihato padīpo"},{"i":68,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Khippaṃ vināsa mukhameti mahappabhopi,"},{"i":69,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Loke tathā maraṇacaṇḍa samīraṇena"},{"i":70,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Khippaṃ vinassati narāyumahā padīpo;"},{"i":71,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"17","t":"Rāmajjunappabhūti bhūpati puṃgavā ca"},{"i":72,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Sūrā pure raṇamukhe vijitāri saṅghā,"},{"i":73,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Tepīha caṇḍa maraṇogha nimuggadehā"},{"i":74,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Nāsaṃ gatā jagati ke maraṇā pamuttā?"},{"i":75,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"18","t":"Lakkhī ca sāgarapaṭā sadharādharā ca"},{"i":76,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Sampattiyo ca vividhā api rūpasobhā,"},{"i":77,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Sabbā ca tā api ca mittasutā ca dārā"},{"i":78,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Ke cāpi kaṃ anugatā maraṇaṃ vajantaṃ?"},{"i":79,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"hangnum","n":"19","t":"|O0.0007|"},{"i":80,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","t":"Brahmāsurāsuragaṇā ca mahānubhāvā"},{"i":81,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Gandhabbakinnaramahoragarakkhasā ca,"},{"i":82,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Te cā pare ca maraṇaggisikhāya sabbe"},{"i":83,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Ante patanti salabhā iva khīṇapuññā;"},{"i":84,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"20","t":"Ye sāriputtapamukhā munisāvakā ca"},{"i":85,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Suddhā sadāsavanudā paramiddhipattā,"},{"i":86,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Te cāpi maccuvaḷabhā mukha sannimuggā"},{"i":87,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Dīpānivānalahatā khayataṃ upetā;"},{"i":88,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"21","t":"Buddhāpi buddhakamalāmalacārunettā"},{"i":89,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Battiṃsalakkhaṇa virājita rūpasobhā,"},{"i":90,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Sabbāsacakkhayakarāpi ca lokanāthā"},{"i":91,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sammadditā maraṇamattamahāgajena;"},{"i":92,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"hangnum","n":"22","t":"|O0.0008|"},{"i":93,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","t":"Rogāturesu karuṇā na jarāturesu"},{"i":94,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Khiḍḍāparesu sukumārakumārakesu,"},{"i":95,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Lokaṃ sadā hanati maccu mahāgajindo"},{"i":96,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Davānalo vanamivāvarataṃ asesaṃ;"},{"i":97,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"23","t":"Āpuṇṇatā na salile na jalāsayassa"},{"i":98,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Kaṭṭhassa cāpi bahutā na hutāsanassa,"},{"i":99,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Bhutvāna so tibhūvanampi tathā asesaṃ"},{"i":100,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Bho niddayo na khalu pītimupeti maccu;"},{"i":101,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"24","t":"Bho moha mohitatayā vivaso adhañño"},{"i":102,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Loko patatyapipi maccumukhe subhīme,"},{"i":103,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Bhoge ratiṃ samupayāti nihīnapañño"},{"i":104,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Dolā taraṅgacapale supinopameyye;"},{"i":105,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"hangnum","n":"25","t":"|O0.0009|