dosamidaṃ sarīraṃ"},{"i":379,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Niccaṃva taggatamanā hadaye karotha,"},{"i":380,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Mettaṃ parittamasubhaṃ maraṇassatiñca"},{"i":381,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Bhāvetha bhāvanaratā satataṃ yatattā;"},{"i":382,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"89","t":"Dānādi puññakiriyāni sukhudrayāni"},{"i":383,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Katvā ca tamphalamasesa mihappameyyaṃ,"},{"i":384,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Deyyaṃ sadā parahitāya sukhāya ceva"},{"i":385,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Kimbho tadeva nanu hatthagatañhi sāraṃ?"},{"i":386,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"90","t":"Hetuṃ vinā na bhavatī hi ca kiṃci loke"},{"i":387,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Saddova pāṇitalaghaṭṭanahetujāto,"},{"i":388,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Evañca hetuphala bhāvavibhāgabhinno"},{"i":389,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Loko udeti ca vinassati tiṭṭhatī ca;"},{"i":390,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"hangnum","n":"91","t":"|O0.0030|"},{"i":391,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","t":"Kammassa kāraṇāmayañhi yathā avijjā"},{"i":392,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Bho kammanā samadhigacchati jātibhedaṃ,"},{"i":393,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Jātiṃ paṭicca ca jarāmaraṇādidukkhaṃ"},{"i":394,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sattā sadā paṭilabhanti anādikāle;"},{"i":395,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"92","t":"Kammaṃ yathā na bhavatīha ca mohanāsā"},{"i":396,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Kammakkhayāpi ca na hoti bhavesu jāti,"},{"i":397,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Jātikkhayā iha jarāmaraṇādidukkhaṃ"},{"i":398,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sabbakkhayo bhavati dīpevānilena;"},{"i":399,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"93","t":"Yo passatīha satataṃ munidhammakāyaṃ"},{"i":400,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Buddhaṃ sa passati naro iti so avoca,"},{"i":401,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Buddhañca dhammamamalañca tilokanāthaṃ"},{"i":402,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sampassituṃ vicinathā’pi ca dhammataṃ bho;"},{"i":403,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"hangnum","n":"94","t":"|O0.0031|"},{"i":404,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","t":"Sallaṃva bho sunisitaṃ hadaye nimuggaṃ"},{"i":405,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Dosattayaṃ vividhapāpamalena littaṃ,"},{"i":406,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Nānāvidhabyasanabhājanamappasannaṃ"},{"i":407,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Paññāmayena balisena nirākarotha;"},{"i":408,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"95","t":"Nākampayanti sakalāpi ca lokadhammā"},{"i":409,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Cittaṃ sadāpagatapāpakilesasallaṃ,"},{"i":410,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Rūpādayo ca vividhā visayā samaggā"},{"i":411,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Phuṭṭhaṃva merusikharaṃ mahatānilena;"},{"i":412,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"96","t":"Saṃsāradukkhamagaṇeyya yathā munindo"},{"i":413,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Gambhirapāramita sāgaramuttaritvā,"},{"i":414,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Ñeyyaṃ abodhi nipuṇaṃ hatamohajālo"},{"i":415,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Tasmā sadā parahitaṃ paramaṃ ciṇātha;"},{"i":416,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"97","t":"Ohāya so’dhigatamokkhasukhaṃ paresaṃ"},{"i":417,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Atthāya saṃcari bhavesu mahabbhayesu,"},{"i":418,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Evaṃ sadā parahitaṃ purato karitvā"},{"i":419,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Dhammo mayānucarito jagadatthameva;"},{"i":420,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"hangnum","n":"98","t":"|O0.0032|"},{"i":421,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","t":"Laddhāna dullabhatarañca manussayoniṃ"},{"i":422,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Sabbaṃ papañcarahitaṃ khaṇasampadañca,"},{"i":423,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Ñatvāna āsavanudekahitañca dhammaṃ"},{"i":424,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Ko paññavā anavaraṃ na bhajeyya dhammaṃ?"},{"i":425,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"99","t":"Laddhāna buddhasamayaṃ atidullabhaṃca"},{"i":426,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Saddhamma maggamasamaṃ sivadaṃ tatheva,"},{"i":427,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Kalyāṇamittapavare matisampadañca"},{"i":428,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Ko buddhimā anavaraṃ na bhajeyya dhammaṃ?"},{"i":429,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha1","n":"100","t":"Evampi dullabhataraṃ vibhave suladdhā"},{"i":430,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Maccheradosa viratā ubhayatthakāmā,"},{"i":431,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Saddhādidhammasahitā satatappamattā"},{"i":432,"k":"anya-telakatahagatha-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Bho! Bho! Karotha amatādhigamāya puññaṃ;"}]